  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  Measurements of the Bose-Einstein correlation in the production of two charged pions in central PB-PB collisions at a nucleon centre-of-mass energy of 2.76 TeV. The data set includes projections of two-pion correlation functions in various kt regions and the HBT radii in the outward, sideward and longitudinal directions.  Numerical values supplied by Dariusz Miskowiec.\n",
